<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korea's Aug unemployment unchanged at 2.0 pct.</title>
<headline>S.Korea's Aug unemployment unchanged at 2.0 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's seasonally-adjusted unemployment rate was unchanged at 2.0 percent in August from a year earlier, provisional National Statistical Office figures showed on Thursday.</p>
<p>					   Aug     July   Aug 95</p>
<p>    Unemployment (pct)	     2.0	2.0     2.0</p>
<p>					  (1.9)    (1.8)   (1.9)</p>
<p>NOTE: Unemployment rate in brackets calculated before taking seasonal factors into account.</p>
<p>The percentage of the economically active population was 62.5 percent in August, slightly down from 62.7 percent a year earlier.</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5647</p>
</text>
